  "description": "Storm chasing on another level, you can intercept tornadoes!",
  "body": "You can now storm chase in Minecraft!\n\nIn this modpack, there is a car known as the TIV 2 which will let you go inside a tornado\n\n🌪️Mods✈️\nProtoManly's Weather, Automobility, Camerapture, Immersive Aircraft, Tornado Intercept (PMW), WI Zoom, Kelka backpack's, Man of Many Planes, PMW Storms Shake Screen! & a ton of FPS boosting mods.\n\n\nThe modpack is designed for you to go on your own storm chasing adventure!",
